OL,3,GNEWSAHotel shouldn't have been used for
OL,4,Aasylum seekers - minister              
OL,6,FBritannia Hotels, which owns the hotel,
OL,7,Fsaid it was "exploring opportunities to
OL,8,Fre-establish the hotel as a respected  
OL,9,Fcommunity asset".                      
